  "translation": "Na bai i kamap, taim ol i tokim yu: Long wanem yu krai liklik? na yu tok: Long wanem — ol i harim tok; em i kamap nau; na olgeta bel i go sot nogut tru, na olgeta han i lus strong, na olgeta ruak i go daun, na olgeta skru bilong lut i ran wara. Luk, em i kamap nau, na em bai kamap tru — tok bilong Adonai Yahwe.",
